abstract: >-
  Open-source, self-hostable ERP for small and mid-sized businesses:
  invoicing, accounting, VAT and e-invoicing, banking and reconciliation,
  CRM, sales, inventory, procurement, HR, appointments and online booking,
  with country and industry packs and optional AI assistance.
